# Launches an EC2 Fleet. You can create a single EC2 Fleet that includes multiple launch specifications that vary by instance type, AMI, Availability Zone, or subnet. For more information, see EC2 Fleet (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/ec2-fleet.html) in the Amazon EC2 User Guide.
